OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, the rain heavy and
OL,7,Fpersistent at times in the west.
OL,8,FTurning more showery through the
OL,9,Fafternoon with some brighter spells,
OL,10,Fthe best of the brightness around
OL,11,FInverness. Windy, coastal gales at
OL,12,Ftimes.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRemaining showery during this
OL,15,Fevening, these heaviest and most
OL,16,Fwidespread in the west. The showers
OL,17,Fbecoming more scattered overnight with
OL,18,Fclearer spells. Breezy, strong winds
OL,19,Faround the north coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
